mes>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>Jamming the endosomal system: lipid rafts and lysosomal storage diseases.</article-title><source>Trends Cell Biol</source><volume>10</volume><fpage>459</fpage><lpage>462</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11050411</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002933-teVruchte1"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>te Vruchte</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Lloyd-Evans</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Veldman</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Neville</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name><name><surname>Dwek</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Accumulation of glycosphingolipids in Niemann-Pick C disease disrupts endosomal transport.</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><volume>279</volume><fpage>26167</fpage><lpage>26175</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15078881</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002933-Cutler1"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cutler</surname><given-names>RG</given-names></name><name><surname>Kelly</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Storie</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Pedersen</surname><given-names>WA</given-names></name><name><surname>Tammara</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Involvement of oxidative stress-induced abnormalities in ceramide and cholesterol metabolism in brain aging and Alzheimer's disease.</article-title><source>PNAS</source><volume>101</volume><fpage>2070</fpage><lpage>2075</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14970312</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0002933-Han1"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="a